[TITLE]
NUM-12: two storage units filled at 0.5 cfs for 2 hours with no outflow.
SU1 uses curve SC1 (1 ft, 1000 ft2) (6 ft, 1000 ft2); SU2 uses SC2, the same
curve with SWMM's implied area below the first point written out: (0, 0) first.

[OPTIONS]
FLOW_UNITS           CFS
FLOW_ROUTING         DYNWAVE
START_DATE           01/01/2020
START_TIME           00:00:00
REPORT_START_DATE    01/01/2020
REPORT_START_TIME    00:00:00
END_DATE             01/01/2020
END_TIME             02:00:00
REPORT_STEP          00:05:00
WET_STEP             00:05:00
DRY_STEP             00:05:00
ROUTING_STEP         10

[STORAGE]
;;Name Elev MaxDepth InitDepth Shape   Curve
SU1    95   6        0         TABULAR SC1   0 0
SU2    95   6        0         TABULAR SC2   0 0

[OUTFALLS]
O1     90   FREE
O2     90   FREE

[CONDUITS]
;;Name From To Length Rough InOff OutOff
C1     SU1  O1 100    0.013 5.5   0
C2     SU2  O2 100    0.013 5.5   0

[XSECTIONS]
C1     CIRCULAR 0.5 0 0 0 1
C2     CIRCULAR 0.5 0 0 0 1

[INFLOWS]
;;Node Param TSeries Type Mfactor Sfactor Baseline
SU1    FLOW  ""      FLOW 1.0     1.0     0.5
SU2    FLOW  ""      FLOW 1.0     1.0     0.5

[CURVES]
SC1 Storage 1 1000 6 1000
SC2 Storage 0 0 1 1000 6 1000

[REPORT]
NODES ALL
LINKS ALL
